     "text": "What if you jumped into a hole straight through the Earth?",
     "start": 5.638,
     "end": 8.08
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the crust: about 35 kilometers of solid rock.",
   "start": 9.1,
   "end": 13.064,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "First, the crust:",
     "start": 9.1,
     "end": 10.125
    },
    {
     "text": "about 35 kilometers of solid rock.",
     "start": 10.475,
     "end": 13.064
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the mantle: nearly 3,000 kilometers of hot rock.",
   "start": 13.484,
   "end": 17.369,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Then the mantle:",
     "start": 13.484,
     "end": 14.436
    },
    {
     "text": "nearly 3,000 kilometers of hot rock.",
     "start": 14.786,
     "end": 17.369
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, the outer core, an ocean of liquid iron.",
   "start": 17.789,
   "end": 21.006,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Next, the outer core,",
     "start": 17.789,
     "end": 18.987
