    {
     "text": "an ocean of liquid iron.",
     "start": 19.337,
     "end": 21.006
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You'd pass the center at about/ 8 kilometers a second.",
   "start": 21.426,
   "end": 24.831,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "You'd pass the center",
     "start": 21.426,
     "end": 22.594
    },
    {
     "text": "at about/ 8 kilometers a second.",
     "start": 22.944,
     "end": 24.831
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "That's roughly 8 times faster than a rifle bullet.",
   "start": 25.251,
   "end": 28.272,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "That's roughly 8 times faster than a rifle bullet.",
     "start": 25.251,
     "end": 28.272
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Then gravity flips, and starts slowing you down.",
